{{Wireless embedded system |brand=NetweeN |model=C340T |revision=v1 (C310A) |asin= |manuf_country=China |is_manuf=No |manuf= |availability=EoL |fcc_date=06/19/2012 |fcc_id=N7SC340T |pcb_id=300090003001 |type=wireless router |pwr_v=5 |pwr_amp=2 |pwr_conn=barrel |cpu1_brand=Ralink |cpu1_model=RT3052 |cpu1_cspeed= |fla1=4 |fla1_brand=Spansion |fla1_model=S29GL032N90TFI04 |ram1=16 |ram1_brand=EtronTech |ram1_model=EM638165TS-6G |ram1_num=2 |expansion_if_types= |expansion_usb_num= |jtag= |serial= |wi1_chip1_brand=Ralink |wi1_chip1_model=RT3052 |wi1_802dot11_protocols=bgn |wi1_ant_conn= |wi1_txchains=2 |wi1_rxchains=2 |wi1_sstreams=2 |eth_cpu=true |sw_cpu=true |sw_brand= |sw_model= |lan_speed=100M |lan_ports=4 |wan_speed=100M |wan_ports=1 |addl_chips= |flags= |stock_os= |tp_firmware= |802dot11_protocols=bgn |default_ssid=NetweeN |default_ssid_regex=^NetweeN$ |default_ip=192.168.1.1 |default_user= |default_pass= |oui=00:25:A6 |oui_eth=00:25:A6 }}
"300090003001-00" is silkscreened on the board in the FCC photos. :This device probably uses [[Ralink]] RT3052. FCC external photos show the device with a model of C310A.
The default IP is from the FCC submitted manual. :The default SSID is assumed to be ''NetweeN'' :(it's in the manual and it has WiGLE support). :Assumed 00:25:A6 OUI..
